<div class="wrap"><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">A little browsing. A lovely find.</p><h1>Good finds.<br>Fresh beginnings.</h1><p>Electronics, books, clothing, toys, drink mixes, snacks & the unexpected. Give something good its next chapter.</p><a class="button" href="/collections/all">Explore the finds ↗</a></div><div class="hero-art" aria-label="Illustrations of resale categories"><div class="object" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'headphones.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="200" height="200"></div><div class="object" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'books.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="200" height="200"></div><div class="object" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'jacket.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="200" height="200"></div><div class="object" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'bear.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="200" height="200"></div></div></section><div class="trust"><div><strong>Know what you’re getting.</strong> Item-level condition notes</div><div><strong>A second life looks good.</strong> Shop pre-loved favorites</div><div><strong>A shop with a human touch.</strong> Questions? Get in touch</div></div><section class="block"><div class="section-head"><h2>What’s buzzing?</h2><a href="/collections/all">Shop all →</a></div><div class="categories">{% for category in collections %}{% unless category.handle == 'frontpage' or category.handle == 'all' %}<a class="category" href="{{ category.url }}"><span aria-hidden="true">{% case category.handle %}{% when 'electronics' %}<img src="{{ 'headphones.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="72" height="72">{% when 'books', 'book-deals' %}<img src="{{ 'books.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="72" height="72">{% when 'clothing' %}<img src="{{ 'jacket.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="72" height="72">{% when 'toys' %}<img src="{{ 'bear.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="72" height="72">{% else %}{% if category.image %}{{ category.image | image_url: width: 150 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '' }}{% else %}✦{% endif %}{% endcase %}</span><b>{{ category.title | escape }} ↗</b></a>{% endunless %}{% endfor %}</div></section><section class="block"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Worth a second look</p><h2>Find your next favorite.</h2></div><a href="/collections/all">Browse everything →</a></div><div class="grid">{% assign featured = collections[section.settings.collection] %}{% if featured == blank %}{% assign featured = collections.all %}{% endif %}{% assign recent_products = featured.products | sort: 'published_at' | reverse %}{% for product in recent_products limit: 8 %}{% render 'product-card', product: product %}{% else %}<div class="empty">The next good find is on its way. Check back for new arrivals.</div>{% endfor %}</div></section><section class="story" aria-labelledby="academic-help-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">A little guidance. A clearer next step.</p><h2 id="academic-help-title">Academic help,<br>with a personal touch.</h2></div><div><p>Essay Review — $49. Constructive feedback on your own writing, from structure and clarity to grammar and citation consistency.</p><p>Academic Planning — $45. Support with study priorities, deadlines and next steps.</p><a class="button secondary" href="/pages/academic-help">Explore academic help →</a><p class="muted">Ask about availability, scope and timing before booking.</p></div></section><section class="story"><div><p class="eyebrow">The bizi bees way</p><h2>Less brand-new.<br>More you.</h2></div><div><p>A great find doesn’t need to be new. We bring together pre-loved pieces for everyday life, from your next read to something for the toy box.</p><a href="/pages/about">Meet bizi bees →</a></div></section><section class="block"><h2>Good finds, clearly described.</h2><p>Read the condition grade, item notes, and what’s included before you choose.</p><a class="button secondary" href="/pages/condition-guide">How we describe condition</a></section></div>
